    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Isle of the Night!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you\u2019ll gather resources, craft gear, and battle waves of enemies as you try to survive. By day, explore the island and prepare; by night, fight against powerful enemies. Whether you play solo or team up with friends, every choice matters in your fight for survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft, Build, Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269650/extras/e8e91e4aa8939591f958c4a7b5e97916.poster.avif?t=1753275998\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269650/extras/e8e91e4aa8939591f958c4a7b5e97916.webm?t=1753275998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269650/extras/e8e91e4aa8939591f958c4a7b5e97916.mp4?t=1753275998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources and craft essential tools and weapons. Build your arsenal by chopping trees, mining, and hunting for materials. Your survival depends on the gear you create.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Own Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269650/extras/373c1788dc6343daaa2b507aa5b74227.poster.avif?t=1753275998\" width=800 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269650/extras/373c1788dc6343daaa2b507aa5b74227.webm?t=1753275998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269650/extras/373c1788dc6343daaa2b507aa5b74227.mp4?t=1753275998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of random upgrades and power-ups as you gain experience. Shape your playstyle with unique abilities and powerful boosts each time you level up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269650/extras/b768654b092d1ed1a80e75d442a0d302.poster.avif?t=1753275998\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269650/extras/b768654b092d1ed1a80e75d442a0d302.webm?t=1753275998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269650/extras/b768654b092d1ed1a80e75d442a0d302.mp4?t=1753275998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine melee and ranged attacks, and unleash abilities tied to your gear for fast-paced, action-packed combat. And when you feel ready, challenge the powerful bosses that lurk under the island for the ultimate test of your skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive Together in Co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269650/extras/abad64a89107608831e8c072f7df84d1.avif?t=1753275998\" data-has-big width=800 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends. Share resources, strategize together, and gear up to face even tougher waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Isle of the Night!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you\u2019ll gather resources, craft gear, and battle waves of enemies as you try to survive. By day, explore the island and prepare; by night, fight against powerful enemies. Whether you play solo or team up with friends, every choice matters in your fight for survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft, Build, Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269650/extras/e8e91e4aa8939591f958c4a7b5e97916.poster.avif?t=1753275998\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269650/extras/e8e91e4aa8939591f958c4a7b5e97916.webm?t=1753275998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269650/extras/e8e91e4aa8939591f958c4a7b5e97916.mp4?t=1753275998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources and craft essential tools and weapons. Build your arsenal by chopping trees, mining, and hunting for materials. Your survival depends on the gear you create.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Own Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269650/extras/373c1788dc6343daaa2b507aa5b74227.poster.avif?t=1753275998\" width=800 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269650/extras/373c1788dc6343daaa2b507aa5b74227.webm?t=1753275998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269650/extras/373c1788dc6343daaa2b507aa5b74227.mp4?t=1753275998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of random upgrades and power-ups as you gain experience. Shape your playstyle with unique abilities and powerful boosts each time you level up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269650/extras/b768654b092d1ed1a80e75d442a0d302.poster.avif?t=1753275998\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269650/extras/b768654b092d1ed1a80e75d442a0d302.webm?t=1753275998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269650/extras/b768654b092d1ed1a80e75d442a0d302.mp4?t=1753275998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine melee and ranged attacks, and unleash abilities tied to your gear for fast-paced, action-packed combat. And when you feel ready, challenge the powerful bosses that lurk under the island for the ultimate test of your skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive Together in Co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269650/extras/abad64a89107608831e8c072f7df84d1.avif?t=1753275998\" data-has-big width=800 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends. Share resources, strategize together, and gear up to face even tougher waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Korsan adas\u0131nda hayatta kal! Bu roguelike hayatta kalma oyununda g\u00fcnd\u00fcz \u00fcret, gece d\u00fc\u015fman dalgalar\u0131yla sava\u015f. Kaynak topla, g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc yeteneklerin kilidini a\u00e7 ve artan tehditlere kar\u015f\u0131 koymak i\u00e7in ekipman\u0131n\u0131 geli\u015ftir. Bu amans\u0131z hayatta kalma m\u00fccadelesinde ne kadar dayanabileceksin?",
